  "practice": [
    "Say ঢ় with an approximate flapped and aspirated ṛh sound: ṛhô, ṛhô, ṛhô.",
    "Train your eyes to find ঢ় inside words because it almost never begins a normal Bangla word: গাঢ়, দৃঢ়, আষাঢ়, মূঢ়, and রূঢ়.",
    "Compare ড়, which is much more common, with ঢ়: বড় / গাঢ়, ঘড়ি / দৃঢ়, গাড়ি / রূঢ়, পড়া / আষাঢ়.",
    "Compare ঢ and ঢ় carefully: the dot underneath changes ঢ into ঢ়. Practice ঢাকা, ঢাকনা, ঢেউ, and ঢাল versus গাঢ়, দৃঢ়, রূঢ়, and আষাঢ়.",
    "Use গাঢ়, দৃঢ়, দৃঢ়তা, রূঢ়, রূঢ়তা, আষাঢ়, and মূঢ় as quick reading anchors.",
    "Recognize these phrases instantly: গাঢ় নীল, গাঢ় রং, দৃঢ় সিদ্ধান্ত, দৃঢ়ভাবে ধরো, and রূঢ়ভাবে কথা বলো না."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ঢ় is one of the least common Bangla consonants. Its name is ṛhô and its sound is roughly a flapped aspirated rh or ṛh.",
    "ঢ় almost never begins a normal Bangla word. It is mainly encountered inside a small set of words.",
    "ড় is much more common than ঢ়. Compare বড়, ঘড়ি, গাড়ি, পড়া, and দাঁড়ানো with গাঢ়, দৃঢ়, রূঢ়, and আষাঢ়.",
    "ঢ and ঢ় are different letters. The dot underneath ঢ creates ঢ়, changing the letter and its pronunciation.",
    "আষাঢ় is a Bengali calendar month that falls roughly around June and July.",
    "The most useful ঢ় words to memorize are গাঢ়, দৃঢ়, দৃঢ়তা, দৃঢ়ভাবে, রূঢ়, রূঢ়তা, আষাঢ়, and মূঢ়."
